# The build sees only the page's and the server's sources (web/server-rs/Dockerfile): never the game folder, gen/,
# out/ or anything else of this checkout.  A list of what may go in, not of what may not.
*
!app/registry-defaults.txt
!CHANGELOG.md
!web/package.json
!web/package-lock.json
!web/build.mjs
!web/index.html
!web/src/
!web/server-rs/
web/server-rs/target/
